Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)我不信！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塔奇恩·龙竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然背叛我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)米扎艾尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强的龙使 是我才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)新银河眼塔奇恩·龙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障光解放！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.01,0:00:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)再这样下去 凯特会！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:34.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(菲卡博士)凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.89,0:00:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.05,0:00:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)你 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别瞎操心！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人 如果俺变成废铁了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.46,0:00:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就跟奥波米大人说 俺勇敢地战斗过了请您转告。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯特)我拒绝。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)哎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事你自己去说！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.69,0:00:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)凯特大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:00:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥波米)加油啊，你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个声音……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥波米小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.22,0:01:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺是不会在这种地方认输的！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.74,0:02:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到此就是回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.39,0:02:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来总算是撑住了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)凯……凯特大人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.32,0:03:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯，你那边呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}损伤率50％还远远能打下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)海马 你的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.94,0:03:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有怪兽 手牌也是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这副样子还要继续战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.52,0:03:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是 我命运的一抽》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.19,0:03:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马大人 虽绵薄之力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这奥比塔尔 前来助您一臂之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我和…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}俺的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)命运的一抽！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了… 有这张的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样结束回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走投无路盖了只杂鱼怪兽吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:04:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 银河的施舍！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果 我将
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一张卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从卡组抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动速攻魔法大西洲·刷新！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己场上的1只怪兽除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将新·大西洲除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，装备在新·大西洲上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利·银河会被送入墓地。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，被除外的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会回到原本的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.42,0:04:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将新·大西洲除外一次，让攻击力恢复原状了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，发动装备魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大西洲·落瀑·加农炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡装备到新·大西洲上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力会下降500点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但在战斗结束后，将攻击力变为一半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能进行连续攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 直到新生·大飞蛾的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降到500以下为止{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个效果 都可以使用！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎么会！ 那海马他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 新生·大飞蛾攻击那家伙的守备卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.47,0:05:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)银河镜·圣者的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值 恢复800点。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这张卡被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.75,0:05:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以再次 放置到场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无谓的抵抗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 通过这个效果放置的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}离开场上时 会被除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 大飞蛾·坠落·加农的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽 在攻击后攻击力减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次可以进行攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再次用新塔奇昂攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河镜面圣者的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复我800点生命值！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河镜面圣者已被除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那招已经用不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我再次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.48,0:06:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动塔奇昂·坠落·加农的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减半第三次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新塔奇昂 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗大人由我来保护……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}塔奇昂·坠落·加农的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要…… 快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 这是最后一击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 塔奇恩·坠天·加农！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.53,0:07:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）系统损伤 90%…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能量剩余 3%…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看那样子胜负已分了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.14,0:07:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快… 快斗大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗… 快斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线]快斗！撑住！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！快斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔！听我说！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种战斗根本没有意义！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也看到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己真正的过去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.65,0:08:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）你那高尚的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被咚·千尊玷污{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被植入了虚假的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怀抱着憎恨与悲伤之心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠入了巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗的一切起因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都在于咚·千尊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.68,0:08:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些都无关紧要！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是为了巴利安而战。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为巴利安七皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想要守护的东西已经不存在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚·千尊和贝库塔联手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把阿里特和基拉古也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不止这些。梅拉古和杜尔伯也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 都被吃掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:08:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]是真的 米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]你想要守护的巴利安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经 不在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要你还在继续使用 新·塔奇yon{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就无法从 唐·萨赞多的咒缚中逃脱！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的新·塔奇yon 竟然是唐·萨赞多的诅咒…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 怎么会这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 是诅咒！ 所以…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器](快斗)星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这家伙从新·塔奇yon中解放出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.51,0:09:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有我才能做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)这场决斗是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.31,0:09:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决定我们未来的决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们不要插手……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 拖着那么残破的身体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再继续下去的话 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 游马 你给我记住……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.01,0:09:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论是谁 离别都必定会到来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天 会突然降临……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]那对你…… 对星光体也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 就拿我来习惯吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕 这是最后的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决出胜负的时刻到了 米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还要继续决斗吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被夺走了银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了所有力量的你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 未来……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们未来的光芒 还没有消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正是 苏醒之时！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操纵未来的光之化身 No.62！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.52,0:10:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·原初·光子·龙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 原初·光子会在这个场上！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原初·光子的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经发动过了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原初·光子离开场上的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.56,0:11:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}经过多少回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会复活到场上来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙被 快子混沌洞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸进去的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材是 2个！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 经过了2回合的现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它现身了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}250…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在新快子的攻击力是\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2500…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.77,0:11:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击打中的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海马就能赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼·原初·光子·龙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 最强的龙是我的新时空龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后最强的龙使 就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 超时空单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上的 新时空龙的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.89,0:11:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量单位使用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:54.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过支付我500生命值变为可以发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将场上 除了这张卡以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡的效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并回到这个回合开始时的状态！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时间回溯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 装备在新时空龙上的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}时空落瀑炮的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为无效攻击力回到 4500！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，原始光子还会回到召唤前的状态。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.89,0:12:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧，原始光子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧，原始光子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么原始光子没有消失？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，新时空是将所有时间都回溯了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，回溯的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有这个回合发动的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原始光子的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是在两个回合前发动的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算能回溯时间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也无法支配我的未来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然超越了新时空的效果？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，即便如此攻击力是新时空更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用至尊光子是攻击不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，米迦勒！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至尊光子龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击新塔基翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永恒光子流！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我反击回去，新塔基翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极塔基翁螺旋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米迦勒，为什么你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成了龙使？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.02,0:13:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你身上发生过什么，我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，你无法相信他人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择了相信龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这双荒凉的眼睛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:14:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那块石碑上描绘的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.43,0:14:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那双眼睛，何其相似。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((米迦勒：父亲大人，母亲大人…))
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别可怜我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没有可怜你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强的龙使，就是你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想救弟弟和老爸。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是一心为了这个才利用了龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用了银河眼的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，与那仅仅一张
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卡片的相遇，引导了我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我变得如此强大。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我被银河眼引导{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与游马、Astral相遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与凌牙、众多同伴相遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后得以与你相遇。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.97,0:16:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙教会了孤独{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法相信任何人的这样的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信他人的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐，米扎艾尔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 下次还能再相遇的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你身上发生过什么能不能说给我听？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 够了 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别再继续了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.47,0:16:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥 我不要… 我不要啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙·Prime·光子龙的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤这只怪兽的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗时 攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将去除的叠放单元数量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:16:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相乘的数值！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 8000！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙·Prime·光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 银河眼的真正姿态？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.龙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}( orbital 7 ) 快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}( orbital 7 ) 成功了……快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Orbital，你也干得很好。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于……被夸奖了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最喜欢的……快……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Orbital。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，快斗，你振作点！喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还要跟我再决斗一场的吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你还没分出胜负呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.72,0:19:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过那件事，就留到下次吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来跟我决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别哭了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是最后的希望。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:41.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！别死 不要死啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸 我一点都不后悔。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阳斗 爸就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗… 原谅我。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥！哥～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔… 去吧 走你自己相信的路。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.64,0:20:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会… 快斗他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗… 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）来吧 放马过来吧纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们最后战斗的地方只能在这里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且！ 这里就会成为你的坟墓！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着吧 贝库塔！ 上千主上！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.78,0:21:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上 你这家伙… 饶不了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗… 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（（别哭 游马。你是最后的希望））
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 阿斯特拉尔 我决定了。我不会再哭了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到打赢这场战斗为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的觉悟。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.07,0:22:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 贝库塔！ 咚·千！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.67,0:23:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
